----- stdout -----
Download the output of a job saved as job attachments

Usage: deadline job download-output [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>
          
      --farm-id <FARM_ID>
          
      --queue-id <QUEUE_ID>
          
      --job-id <JOB_ID>
          
      --step-id <STEP_ID>
          
      --task-id <TASK_ID>
          
      --conflict-resolution <CONFLICT_RESOLUTION>
          
  -i, --include <INCLUDE>
          Glob pattern for files to include in download. Repeatable
      --match-paths-by <MATCH_PATHS_BY>
          Match --include filters against JOB (submission) or LOCAL (workstation) paths [default: LOCAL]
      --ignore-storage-profiles
          Ignore storage profile configuration. Downloads to unmapped paths
      --yes
          
      --output <OUTPUT>
          [default: verbose]
  -h, --help
          Print help

